msgid "Started in the background; the reading below follows when the modem is back."
msgstr "已在后台开始；调制解调器恢复后下方读数会更新。"

msgid "Automatic ($0 supported)"
msgstr "自动（支持 $0 个）"

msgid "Reading the locks from the modem; try again in a few seconds."
msgstr "正在从调制解调器读取锁定；请几秒后重试。"

