msgstr "解除所有小区锁定"

msgid "no cell lock"
msgstr "无小区锁定"

msgid "A cell lock is not kept in the modem across a restart: with \"Apply at startup\" on, the device sends it again at every boot."
msgstr "小区锁定在重启后不会保留在调制解调器中：开启“启动时应用”后，设备每次启动都会重新发送。"

msgid "Startup and reset"
msgstr "启动与重置"

msgid "Do not apply at startup"
msgstr "启动时不应用"

msgid "Reset all to automatic"
msgstr "全部重置为自动"

msgid "Network mode automatic, EN-DC on, every LTE and NR band, no cell lock; the saved locks are cleared, so nothing is applied at startup."
msgstr "网络模式自动、EN-DC 开启、所有 LTE 和 NR 频段、无小区锁定；已保存的锁定将被清除，启动时不再应用任何设置。"

msgid "Off: nothing is sent at startup; the saved settings stay."
msgstr "关闭：启动时不发送任何设置；已保存的设置保留。"

msgid "Reading the locks from the modem..."
msgstr "正在从调制解调器读取锁定..."

