msgstr "用户名"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "密码"

msgid "From"
msgstr "发件人"

msgid "To"
msgstr "收件人"

msgid "Phone number (sent as one SMS: a longer message is cut short)"
msgstr "手机号码（以一条短信发送：过长的消息会被截断）"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

msgid "Send a test"
msgstr "发送测试"

msgid "A test with the saved settings started; its result comes in the delivery log."
msgstr "已使用已保存的设置开始测试；结果将显示在投递日志中。"

msgid "Tokens, passwords and the webhook address and headers stay on the device and are never shown again. A test uses the saved settings: save first."
msgstr "令牌、密码以及 webhook 地址和请求头保存在设备上，不会再次显示。测试使用已保存的设置：请先保存。"

msgid "APN"
msgstr "APN"

msgid "SIM"
msgstr "SIM 卡"

msgid "Data roaming"
msgstr "数据漫游"

msgid "Off: data held back while roaming"
msgstr "关闭：漫游时已暂停数据"

msgid "Allowed"
msgstr "允许"

msgid "Turn data roaming off"
msgstr "关闭数据漫游"

msgid "Allow data roaming"
msgstr "允许数据漫游"

msgid "While the SIM is registered on a roaming network, mobile data stays off; SMS, calls and the registration are not affected. Some SIMs report roaming at home (an MVNO, national roaming): there, data would stop as well."
msgstr "当 SIM 卡注册在漫游网络上时，移动数据保持关闭；短信、通话和网络注册不受影响。部分 SIM 卡在本地也会报告漫游（虚拟运营商、国内漫游）：在那里数据同样会停止。"

msgid "Mobile data is used on roaming networks too, which can cost extra. Some SIMs report roaming at home (an MVNO, national roaming) and need this to have data at all."
msgstr "移动数据也会在漫游网络上使用，可能产生额外费用。部分 SIM 卡在本地也会报告漫游（虚拟运营商、国内漫游），需要开启此项才能使用数据。"

msgid "Empty: the network's own APN. A change reconnects mobile data."
msgstr "留空：使用网络自己的 APN。更改后将重连移动数据。"

msgid "(unchanged)"
msgstr "（未更改）"

msgid "Remove the user name and password"
msgstr "移除用户名和密码"

msgid "IP type"
msgstr "IP 类型"

msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "认证方式"

msgid "The APN may hold letters, digits, dots and hyphens."
msgstr "APN 只能包含字母、数字、点和连字符。"

msgid "Save the APN settings? Mobile data reconnects (about half a minute)."
msgstr "保存 APN 设置？移动数据将重连（约半分钟）。"

msgid "Card"
msgstr "SIM 卡"

msgid "Ready"
msgstr "就绪"

msgid "Locked (PIN or PUK needed)"
msgstr "已锁定（需要 PIN 或 PUK）"

msgid "No card in this slot"
msgstr "此卡槽无 SIM 卡"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Card (SIM $0)"
msgstr "SIM 卡（SIM $0）"

msgid "Ask the card"
msgstr "查询 SIM 卡"

msgid "No SIM control on this device."
msgstr "此设备没有 SIM 卡控制。"

msgid "SIM in use"
msgstr "正在使用的 SIM 卡"

msgid "SIM $0"
msgstr "SIM $0"

msgid "SIM at the next boot"
msgstr "下次启动时的 SIM 卡"

msgid "Use SIM $0"
msgstr "使用 SIM $0"

msgid "Change the SIM? Mobile data uses the other card from then on (at the next reboot where the device cannot switch live)."
msgstr "切换 SIM 卡？此后移动数据将使用另一张卡（若设备无法实时切换，则在下次重启时生效）。"

msgid "This device has one SIM slot in use."
msgstr "此设备只使用了一个 SIM 卡槽。"

msgid "Built-in SIM 1"
msgstr "内置 SIM 1"

msgid "Built-in SIM 2"
msgstr "内置 SIM 2"

msgid "Built-in SIM 3"
msgstr "内置 SIM 3"

msgid "External SIM"
msgstr "外置 SIM"

msgid "Card in use"
msgstr "当前使用的卡"

msgid "Card at the next boot"
msgstr "下次开机使用的卡"

msgid "As the bootloader sets them"
msgstr "保持引导程序的设置"

msgid "Built-in SIM 3 shares SIM2, the external SIM shares SIM1. The card chosen here is switched in before the modem starts, at the next boot; without a choice the cards stay as the bootloader sets them."
msgstr "内置 SIM 3 与 SIM2 共用，外置 SIM 与 SIM1 共用。此处选择的卡会在下次开机、基带启动前切换到位；未选择时，各卡保持引导程序设置的状态。"

msgid "Use this card from the next boot on?"
msgstr "从下次开机起使用这张卡？"

msgid "Radio per SIM"
msgstr "各 SIM 卡的射频"

msgid "Turn off"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Turn on"
msgstr "开启"

msgid "This SIM will have no calls, SMS or data, and its radio stays off after a reboot until you turn it on again."
msgstr "此 SIM 将无法通话、收发短信和使用数据，重启后其射频仍保持关闭，直到您再次开启。"

msgid "in use"
msgstr "使用中"

msgid "All radios off (airplane mode)"
msgstr "关闭所有射频（飞行模式）"

msgid "Turn every SIM's radio off? No calls, SMS or mobile data until you turn them on again, also after a reboot."
msgstr "关闭所有 SIM 的射频？在您再次开启之前（重启后也是如此），将无法通话、收发短信和使用移动数据。"

msgid "All radios on"
msgstr "开启所有射频"

msgid "Kept across reboots: a radio that is off stays off until it is turned on here."
msgstr "重启后保持：关闭的射频会一直关闭，直到在此处开启。"

msgid "A radio change is under way."
msgstr "射频正在切换。"

msgid "Voice over LTE and 5G"
msgstr "LTE 和 5G 语音"

msgid "VoLTE (on by default) and VoNR (the modem's own choice until set) per SIM; the card in use takes a change at once, the other one at its next start."
msgstr "每张 SIM 卡的 VoLTE（默认开启）和 VoNR（未设置时由调制解调器自行决定）；正在使用的卡立即生效，另一张在下次启动时生效。"

msgid "modem default"
msgstr "调制解调器默认"

msgid "now: $0"
msgstr "当前：$0"

msgid "TTL"
msgstr "TTL"

msgid "Every packet that leaves through mobile data gets this TTL (IPv6: hop limit), so tethered devices look like the device itself (64)."
msgstr "经移动数据发出的每个数据包都使用此 TTL（IPv6：跳数限制），使共享网络的设备看起来就像本设备自身（64）。"

msgid "not changed"
msgstr "未更改"

msgid "Method"
msgstr "方式"

msgid "New TTL"
msgstr "新 TTL"

msgid "Set"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "The TTL is a whole number from 1 to 255."
